Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay. okay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯跟我一起去迪士尼乐园玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, ahem, Ross and I are going to Disneyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一家餐厅吃墨西哥卷饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and we stop at this restaurant for tacos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上那只是一个家伙  改装了他的车子开的路边摊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I say restaurant, I mean a guy, a hibachi, and the trunk of his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯吃了十个墨西哥卷饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Ross has about ten tacos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之我们在玩太空车   罗斯开始觉得不舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And anyway, we're on Space Mountain and Ross starts to feel a little iffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他吐了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. He threw up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他从另一边  把东西全拉了出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, he visited a little town south of throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那菲比有什么秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what was Phoebe's secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比以前的按摩师同事   南西汤普森被开除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, Nancy Thompson, from Phoebe's old massage place, is getting fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就那样  我为了那件事  说出迪士尼的秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it? I gave up my Disneyland story for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   你输了  笨蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hm, that's right. You lose, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你还是要娶我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please still marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   你有助理吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you have an assistant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她打电话来了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did she call?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉她我病了吧   每次都要说我生病了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You told her I was sick, right? Always tell her I am sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   我只是不知道   你怎么决定要雇用谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I-I just don't know. How do you decide who to hire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把选择范围缩小到两个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean I've got it narrowed down to two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个的推荐信很棒   经验非常丰富\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One of them has great references and a lot of experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有另外一个家伙   他怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then, there's this guy. What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他帅呆了  我真的好想哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's so pretty, I want to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办了  告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what to do. Tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了  你知道自己该怎么办   你得雇用第一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, you know what to do. You hire the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别因为他长得帅就雇他当助理   你得考虑到他们的工作能力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't hire an assistants because they're cute. you hire them because they're qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  你说的有道理  我可以再说一件事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I hear what you're saying and-and-and that makes a lot of sense but can I just say one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他有多帅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look how pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   但还是不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. But, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不能雇用他  因为那么做太不专业了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. You can't-You can't hire him because it's not professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是给我的   对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, this is for me, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   你说的对   明天我会雇用西尔达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you're right. I'll hire Hilda tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个又蠢又老   适合这份工作的西尔达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dumb, old, perfect-for-the-job Hilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我瞧瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wo-ha-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让摩妮卡看到照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't show this to Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉她我说  "哇"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And don't tell her about the "Wo-ha-ow!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我们的日子》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  乔伊  嗨  泰瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha, hey, Joey. Hey, Terry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能再跟你见面   好久不见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice to see you again. Been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣   这里的走廊看起来比以前小\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, it's funny these halls look smaller than they used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们搬家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a different building.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史崔克  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Stryker Ramoray, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:09:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候开始   何不现在就开始呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When do you want me to start? Why don't we start right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是试镜的剧本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here are the audition scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试镜  我还以为  你们决定让我饰演那个角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Audition?  I thought you were offering me the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会那么想呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我演过德瑞克医生  他是史崔克的双胞胎哥哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was Doctor Drake Ramoray, Stryker's twin brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会比我长得更像我呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, who looks more like me than me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都得参加试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody has to audition. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  秦瑞  我真的不需要这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Terry, I don't really need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有自己的第四台电视剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got my own cable TV series...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟机器人搭档演出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  乔伊  这是规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, Joey. that's...That's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你以为你很特别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I guess you think you're pretty special, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你坐在漂亮的小办公室里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sitting up here in your fancy, small-hailed building...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要大明星在你面前试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...making stars jump through hoops for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是那个大明星\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is one star whose hoop--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是试演的大明星   试演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is the star the hoop-This hoop--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是德瑞克雷莫瑞医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was Doctor Drake Ramoray!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   泰格   你来这里做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Tag. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我特地过来谢谢你  昨天没当着我的面笑我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to come by and thank you for not laughing in my face yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到你办公室里没有植物   所以就帮你带盆植物过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I noticed there were no plants  in your office so I brought you your first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你办公室里有植物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There is a plant in your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以那么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜我不应该在履历表上写着  "注意力敏锐"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I guess I shouldn't put "good at noticing stuff" on my resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  总之\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你录取了别人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway...I'm guessing you hired somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜中了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你愿意面试我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks again for meeting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我录取了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I hired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   对   你得到了这份工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah, you got the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的新助理   真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're my new assistant. I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信   我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it. Ha, ha, me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  首先我要你到楼下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, all right, first thing I need you to do is go downstairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找一个叫西尔达的女人   要她回家去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and find a woman named Hilda, and tell her to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  太好了  你回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, good, you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这要比听到  "该死  又是你" 还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh it's always nicer to hear than, "Oh, crap, you again."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  我帮你准备了一个大惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, sweetie, I made you a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗   对   墨西哥卷饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah? Yeah, tacos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听完那个故事后   我就一直都想吃墨西哥卷饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever since you told me that story, I've had such a craving for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听不懂那个故事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you not understand the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   嗨   有什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事   我只是想知道晚餐要吃什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, nothing. Just trying to figure out what I'm gonna do for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   那是什么   晚餐吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, ooh, what's that? Dinner stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做晚餐   没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You making dinner? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么   墨西哥卷饼吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What you got over there? Tacos?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们只是  只是些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're umm... They're just, uh-They're--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牛肉包大饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're ground beef smileys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是墨西哥卷饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, those are tacos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起   墨西哥先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, Mr. Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系   我不吃了   我还是不敢吃那玩意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Either way, I'll pass. I still can't eat those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事那么好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟她说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You told her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南西汤普森被开除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nancy Thompson's getting fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   那时我食物中毒   我不是故意要那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Okay, okay. I had food poisoning. It's not like I chose to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又没有说  "该怎么做才会更好玩呢"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not like—It's not like I said, "What would make this ride more fun?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你说的对  抱歉  我不该笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. You're right, I'm sorry. I shouldn't be laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该帮你先铺好报纸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should be laying down papers for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以告诉她   我非说不可  我们要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could you tell her?! I had to okay?! We're getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夫妻之间不该藏有秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Married couples can't keep secrets from one another!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜摩妮卡应该知道  在大西洋城发生的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh really? L-I guess Monica should know about Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Du--ude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大西洋城发生了什么事   钱德跟我在酒吧里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened in Atlantic City?! Well, Chandler and I are in a bar--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有听到我说 "兄弟"吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you not hear me say, "Du--ude"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个女孩跟钱德抛媚眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And this girl is making eyes at Chandler. okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿之后  他走过去   一两分钟后我看到他们在接吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So after awhile he goes over to her and, uh, after a minute or two, I see them kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会觉得他是那种会在酒吧里  泡女人的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're thinking, Chandler's  not the type to go to bars and make out with girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是对的   他的确不是那种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're right. Chandler's not the type of guy ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在酒吧里泡女人的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who just goes to bars and make out with "girls."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟男人接吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You kissed a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得为自己辩解下   那时很暗   而且他长得很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In my defense, it was dark and he was a very pretty guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老妹  我笑得很大声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Mon, I laughed so hard--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑到又拉了一裤子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ho-ho, so hard we had to throw out your underwear again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便你  兄弟  你吻了男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever, dude. You kissed a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西尔达怎么样  适应的还好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, how's Hilda? Is she working out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我的新助理适应的很好  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my new assistant is working out. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很高兴能够得到这份工作吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was she happy you gave her the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的新助理非常高兴   我雇用了我的新助理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My new assistant is very happy that I hired my new assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   你能等一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey! Can you hang on a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是《麦克与起司》的制片打来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the producers over at Mac and C.H.E.E.S.E...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先失陪一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if you'll excuse me for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   我没想到你会打来   我正在看下星期的剧本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, funny you should call. I was just looking over next week's script.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取消了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不播了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like, they're taking it off the air? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   星期一见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll see you Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再拍了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not even shooting them anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们取消了《麦克与起司》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They canceled Mac and C.H.E.E.S.E.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾   我真的很遗憾   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sorry. Oh, I'm sorry Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要那么做   那出戏很棒  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would they do that? It was a good show, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想说秘密吗   好吧   念大学时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to tell secrets? Okay, Okay! in college...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯都会穿卫生裤了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Ross used to wear leg warmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   钱德参加模仿香草冰大赛   还拿到了冠军\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, All right! Chandler entered a Vanilla Ice look-alike contest and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯得了第四名   抱头痛哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross came in fourth and cried!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那很好笑吗   你觉得那很好笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, is that funny? Oh, You find that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许钱德也应该   知道你的一些秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well maybe Chandler should know your secrets too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都告诉他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. Oh, I-I already told him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You shush!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次她被罚不准吃晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Once Monica was sent to her room without dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果她吃掉了  她用意大利面做的珠宝盒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so she ate the macaroni off a jewelry box she'd made.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯每个星期六晚上   都待在家里看《黄金女郎》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross stayed home every Saturday night to watch Golden Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡到13岁才会看时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica couldn't tell time until she was 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对有些人就是很难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's hard for some people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德曾穿我的内裤去上班   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler one time wore my underwear to work! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起   我想不出来罗斯还有什么糗事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry, I couldn't think of any more for Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在大学时   有一次钱德喝醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh! Ohh! In college, Chandler got drunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟打扫房间的清洁妇上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and slept with the lady who cleaned our dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便   兄弟   你亲了男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever, dude. You kissed a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事怎么会发生在我身上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could this happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天  我演出两出电视剧  今天  我什么都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yesterday, I had two TV shows. Today, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  《我们的日子》呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, what happened to Days of our Lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有点生我的气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, they might be a little mad at me over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我有点太嚣张了   我告诉他们该怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe I got a little upset, and maybe I told them where they could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你为什么要那么做呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为  他们要我试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because! They wanted me to audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是个演员   那么做太过分了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You, an actor? That's madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋葛瑞办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel Green's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,秦格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   谁打电话找我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人   我只是在练习\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody. I was just practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   嗨   瑞秋葛瑞办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi, Rachel Green's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定是西尔达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must be Hilda. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是泰格   这位是菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's Tag. This is Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   你能进来一下吗   嗯嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, can I see you for a sec'? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  嗯嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个名字很不错   你喜欢吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a great name. You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该听听我的电话号码  好吧  我们马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should hear my phone number. Okay. We'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了自己雇用了那个大帅哥  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you hired yourself a little treat, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这样看起来像什么   菲比  但是我要告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right I know, I know how it looks, Pheebs, but I am telling you--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能勾搭你的助理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But-but you know you can't get involved with your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道雇用他  不是明智之举\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I know that. I know that, and I know that hiring him was probably not the smartest thing that I've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但从现在开始   我发誓我们之间是纯公事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, from now on, I swear this is strictly professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  嘿   瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Hey, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你助理很帅   他什么情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cute assistant. What's his story?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是  是同性恋吗  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is he--? Gay? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  秦瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Terry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  乔伊崔比亚尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很惊讶像你这样的大人物   会到我们的小办公室来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm surprised your big head could fit through our small halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了  乔伊   等下   泰瑞   听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta go, Joey. Wait, Terry! Look, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前的事我抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个白痴   以为自己很大牌根本不必来试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was an idiot, thinking I'm too big to audition for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再给我一次机会吧   我办不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta give me another chance. I can't help you Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  秦瑞  求求你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, Terry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我失去了我另一份工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I just lost my other job, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我多需要这出戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have no idea how much I need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  帮帮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是老朋友了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For old times' sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙昏迷了五年   已经没希望了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This  poor guy's been in a coma for five years. It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会的  史崔克医生最擅长展现奇迹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not hopeless! Dr. Stryker Ramoray is a miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德瑞克   我是你弟弟史崔克   你听到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Drake, it's your brother, Stryker. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又回来了   宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm back, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的解释是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, in my defense, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意大利面上没有珠宝   而且我用的胶水很少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...there was no glitter on the macaroni and very little glue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的解释是   那个清洁妇勾引我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And in my defense, the cleaning lady came on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在会看时间了  对吧   会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have no trouble telling time now right? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点   现在几点了  不知道  吻男人的时间到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Quick, what time is it? I don't know! Time to kiss a guy maybe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在笑什么  尿布宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you laughing at, Pampers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我说夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know when I said that because we're getting married
